			"notes": "### Additions\n\n- Added Hihi'irokane, a new top-tier ore, alongside associated tools, armor, and advancements\n- Added a new smithing template to upgrade Netherite gear into Hihi'irokane, you can find this in End cities\n- Added the Fairy Charm\n- Added some items and blocks to relevant common tags\n\n### Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies\n- Made custom armors trimmable\n- Adjusted some textures\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed a misaligned slot when viewing Ritual Crafting recipes\n- Fixed incorrect namespace in some recipes\n- Fixed an index out of bounds error with the Ritual Shrine\n- Fixed missing texture on antiquarian zombie villagers"
