			"notes": "### Additions\n\n- The wandering trader now has a chance to offer life fragments and ghastly send-off lanterns\n- Added a campfire recipe for lamprey\n- Some items are now usable as fuel\n- Added German, Russian and Ukrainian translations (thanks @ShellshockedFox and @Dosefi)\n- Added a folding chair\n- Added ice fairies\n- Added Enchanted Ice, together with a new bullet modifier and the Icicle Sword\n- Added the levitation suspicious stew to the food item group (because why not)\n\n### Changes\n\n- Updated several tags\n- Improved enchantment compatibility\n- Updated Antiquarian trades\n- Hourai Elixir has been overhauled and should be more balanced in survival now (it's still disabled by default)\n- The elixir command can now also set the elixir level to a specific number instead of just clearing\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Added missing bullet entity translations\n- Fixed a crash involving trinkets\n- Fixed not being able to enchant axes with Youkai Buster"
		},
